// Task - SL9_Kheldian_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3529433772" "The Nictus may be preparing to set up Shadow Cysts in Paragon City. If they were to accomplish this, they could flood the city with Nictus, creating a catastrophe on a scale beyond imagination. We have to know if they've been able to get shadow seeds into the city, and where they may have taken them. Thanks to your hard work, we know that the Center was very interested in a ship that came to Paragon from Italy, where there's long been rumored to be an active Shadow Cyst. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We now have to find out if they've really got the seeds over here.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3766031609" "Investigate the cargo ship"
// SendOffString :
"P380288046" "If we have any luck at all, they won't really have any Shadow Seeds, just the threat of them. You can't take any chances though. If they do have a seed or a cyst, you must destroy it. Also keep your eyes open for any clues or information that might tell us about the next phase of their plan."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2161546738" "Search cargo ship"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P205589872" "Be very thorough in that cargo ship. Who knows what could be lurking in there?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3969889990" "A growing shadows seems to gnaw at the interior of this lurching vessel."

