// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3758511620" "You found an unfinished letter"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4051619920" "You defeated Requiem himself and destroyed the shadow cyst crystals!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1555340663" "This is a day of celebration around the world, if for no other reason that Requiem's capture. Unfortunately, our job still isn't done. We've been going over the manifest of the cargo ship, and found that there were originally 13 shadow seeds aboard. After you destroyed the Cyst Requiem was protecting, that leaves 6 unnaccounted for. The instructions on the letter you found may tell us where they are, and what you'll have to face to destroy them."
// RandomFameString :
"P1433687411" "I didn't beleive it either, but Requiem's been captured! {HeroName} did it, of course! I knew those Kheldians were alright!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Kheldian_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3818450911" "Celebrations over Requiem's capture have broken out all over the world, but it will be a short-lived celebration if we can't stop Arakhn. We have the location where she's overseeing the last of the Shadow Seeds, trying to create another cyst. That cannot be allowed to happen. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You must defeat Arakhn and destroy the last Shadow Cyst.</A> Take all the allies you can find. This is the end."
// AcceptString :
"P2926748729" "Defat Arakhn and destroy the last Shadow Seeds"
// SendOffString :
"P1875405857" "Arakhn's back is to the wall, this is her last chance and she knows it. Be ready for anything. And good luck."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2773655951" "Destroy last Cyst"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2492007508" "You feel a strange dark energy reaching through this place into the dark spaces of the void."

