// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4078681114" "It is almost done, and soon I shall welcome the cleansing flood of shadow from the stars."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3799683710" "You have defied our power for too long, {HeroName}. Now I shall end this miserable existance with the full power of the Nictus!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - TheMainMan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3029373105" "Defeat Arakhn"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4018073226" "You have defeated Arakhn, ending the threat of the Nictus on Earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P928697148" "You Defeated Arakhn and destroyed the last Shadow Seed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3044874539" "It's over. The Nictus have been captured, and their centuries of plotting foiled. The Council is rebuilding, and the leaderless Galaxy and War wolf soldiers are re-joining it, but they may never be as strong again. People all over the world are celebrating your victory, {HeroName}. There's still much to do on Earth, but some of us will leave this world soon. There are other places in the cosmos where the Nictus gather and grow strong. In each of those places, when things look bleak, I know that your name will be spoken, and the story of your battle against the Nictus on Earth will be retold to inspire a thousand generations to come."
// RandomFameString :
"P3640334044" "The Nictus were defeated? Wow. I hope that the Kheldians stay for a while. I liked having them around."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
